{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have been selected to work as a maintenance technician at Quantum Clove, a cutting-edge quantum physics laboratory. Your task is to ensure the proper functioning of the facilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666200/extras/Steam_Gif_01.gif?t=1744790249\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After the launch of a new machine, everything starts to fail more frequently: systems destabilize, the temperature rises, and lights flicker. During one of the tests, the lights go out and in the containment room you hear something that sends chills down your spine. Later, the systems fail completely, and you come face-to-face with something unimaginable, something not of this world that defies all logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666200/extras/Steam_Gif_02.gif?t=1744790249\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now, the laboratory has become a dark underground prison where nightmares roam free. You have no choice but to use stealth and think quickly to find a way to escape the place alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Monorail:</strong> Move quickly through the underground facilities with this handy vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Stealth-Based Gameplay:</strong> Use the environment to hide and crouch to avoid enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Increasing Tension:</strong> Calm is just a prelude; soon, terror and adrenaline will push you to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Investigate:</strong> Search for clues and explore the area if you want to better understand what is happening.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3666200?t=1744790249","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666200/52e29f7e4f2002b150aac9d096e2ea452e83872a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744790249","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666200/7765ebbaf1d1dadb007407a4b366d135a497a53e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744790249","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666200/7765ebbaf1d1dadb007407a4b366d135a497a53e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744790249","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have been selected to work as a maintenance technician at Quantum Clove, a cutting-edge quantum physics laboratory. Your task is to ensure the proper functioning of the facilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666200/extras/Steam_Gif_01.gif?t=1744790249\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After the launch of a new machine, everything starts to fail more frequently: systems destabilize, the temperature rises, and lights flicker. During one of the tests, the lights go out and in the containment room you hear something that sends chills down your spine. Later, the systems fail completely, and you come face-to-face with something unimaginable, something not of this world that defies all logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666200/extras/Steam_Gif_02.gif?t=1744790249\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now, the laboratory has become a dark underground prison where nightmares roam free. You have no choice but to use stealth and think quickly to find a way to escape the place alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Monorail:</strong> Move quickly through the underground facilities with this handy vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Stealth-Based Gameplay:</strong> Use the environment to hide and crouch to avoid enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Increasing Tension:</strong> Calm is just a prelude; soon, terror and adrenaline will push you to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Investigate:</strong> Search for clues and explore the area if you want to better understand what is happening.</p>","developers":["Cubyte Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666200/74c871a62b955335c90d2fdcda7d4c1c7ec1d331/header.jpg?t=1744790249","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257125256,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125256/movie480.mp4?t=1744743961","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125256/movie_max.mp4?t=1744743961"},"name":"Quantum Resonance - Steam Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257125256/d65233da8a3aa6c68b2d0a3a205cf33a8c1a4936/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744743961","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125256/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744743961","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125256/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744743961"}}],"name":"Quantum Resonance","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8300H or AMD Ryzen 5 3550H<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GT 730 or AMD Radeon R7 250<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"pl